  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<span style='font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;'>Les\nensembles de données sont des résumés portant sur l’eau de la rivière des\nOutaouais non traitée, l’eau traitée sortant de chaque usine de purification de\nl’eau (usine Britannia et usine de l’île Lemieux) et le réseau central de\ndistribution pour chaque année civile. Ces ensembles de données résument\ndifférents paramètres physiques, chimiques, microbiologiques et radiologiques. </span><span style='font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;'><br />\n<br />\n<span style='background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;'>Les rapports complets sur la qualité de l’eau sont\naccessibles en ligne à l’adresse </span></span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA'><a href='http://www.ottawa.ca/fr/env_water/water_sewer/water_wells/wells/city_wells/index.html' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='color: rgb(0, 121, 193); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;'>http://www.ottawa.ca/fr/env_water/water_sewer/water_wells/wells/city_wells/index.html </span></a></span><span style='font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;'><br />\n<br />\n<strong><span style='background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;'>Exactitude</span></strong><span style='background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;'>: À ce que l’on sache, les résumées ne comportent pas d’erreur </span><br />\n<br />\n<strong><span style='background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;'>Fréquence\ndes mises à jour</span></strong><span style='background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;'>: annuelle </span><br />\n<br />\n<strong><span style='background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;'>Courriel de\nl'auteur</span></strong><span style='background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;'>: </span></span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\nmso-ansi-language:EN-CA;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA'><a href='mailto:nfo-water@ottawa.ca' rel='nofollow ugc'><span style='color: rgb(0, 121, 193); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;'>Drinking Water\nServices, Water Quality Assurance Unit</span></a></span><br /><br /><div><p><strong>Avis de téléchargement :</strong> <em>Si vous éprouvez des difficultés à télécharger le fichier avec Microsoft Edge, essayez de désactiver l'option « Ouvrir les fichiers Office dans le navigateur » dans les paramètres.</em></p></div>"
